{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02861","headline":"和许侍郎游昆明池 · 李百药","name":"和许侍郎游昆明池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神池望不极，沧波接远天。\n仪星似河汉，落景类虞泉。\n年深平馆宇，道泰偃戈船。\n差池下凫雁，掩映生云烟。\n浪花开已合，风文直且连。\n税马金堤外，横舟石岸前。\n羽觞倾绿蚁，飞日落红鲜。\n积水浮深智，明珠曜雅篇。\n大鲸方远击，沈灰独未然。\n知君啸俦侣，短翮徒联翩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}